妈妈：{0100:0}，喜欢你的新
房间吗？{be01}
太好了！房间收拾得
很整洁呢！{be01}
楼下的行李也都整理
完毕了。{be01}
宝可梦搬家服务真方
便啊！{be01}
对了，记得检查一下
你桌子上的东西是不
是都齐了。

Huh?
Who... Who are you?{be01}
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...{be01}
Oh, you’re {0100:0}.
So your move was today.{be01}
Um... I’m May.
Glad to meet you!{be01}
I...
I have this dream of becoming friends{be00}
with Pokémon all over the world.{be01}
I... I heard about you, {0100:0}, from
my dad, Prof. Birch.{be01}
I was hoping that you would be nice,
{0100:0}, and that we could be friends.{be01}
Oh, this is silly, isn’t it?
I... I’ve just met you, {0100:0}.{be01}
Eheheh...{be01}
Oh, no! I forgot!{be01}
I was supposed to go help Dad catch
some wild Pokémon!{be01}
{0100:0}, I’ll catch you later!

小遥：{0100:0}！{be01}
我在看我的宝可梦图
鉴呢。{be01}
有很多我看见却没捕
捉的宝可梦，{be01}
还有些我想可能会进
化。{be01}
不知道下面该去哪儿
捕捉宝可梦呢？
